{
    "classifiedPR": "2785",
    "prTitle": "MnemonicCode: in `toMnemonic()` throw unchecked rather than checked exception",
    "prDescription": "When converting from entropy to mnemonic with `toMnemonic()`, a `MnemonicLengthException` was thrown for entropies with invalid length. This is bad for two reasons:\r\n\r\n- it is a checked exception, and the method will not be called with user input\r\n- misleading exception name, the error is about the entropy length not the mnemonic\r\n\r\nWe now throw a `RuntimeException` instead. The resulting simplification of calling code can be witnessed in `DeterministicSeed`.",
    "prLocation": "https://github.com/bitcoinj/bitcoinj/pull/2785",
